      "ha": "An nazarci labaran Turanci wajen gano jigogi. Sunayen jigogi da bayanan Hausa fassarar gwaji ne da ke jiran bitar mutum.",
      "ha_reviewed": false
    },
    "topics": {
      "en": "Themes describe patterns in published words. Filters select from one saved model; they do not retrain it.",
