    "connections": {
      "en": "An article connection means two names appear in the same report. Recorded cooperation and agreements have separate evidence and qualifications.",
      "ha": "Alaƙar labari tana nufin sunaye biyu sun bayyana a rahoto ɗaya. Haɗin gwiwa da yarjejeniyoyin da aka ruwaito suna da nasu hujjoji da sharudda.",
      "ha_reviewed": false
    },
    "categories": {
      "en": "A report can have several categories. Period counts use the displayed number of selected reports as their denominator.",
      "ha": "Rahoto na iya shiga rukuni fiye da ɗaya. Lissafin kowane lokaci ya dogara da adadin rahotannin da aka zaɓa da aka nuna.",
      "ha_reviewed": false
    },
    "figures": {
      "en": "Delivery figures are attributed reports. Targets remain plans. Overlapping groups cannot be added into a reliable total of unique people.",
      "ha": "Lambobin tallafin da aka bayar suna dogara da rahotannin da aka ambata. Manufofin cimmawa tsare-tsare ne. Ba za a haɗa ƙungiyoyin da ka iya maimaita mutane domin samun tabbatacciyar jimillar mutane ba.",
      "ha_reviewed": false
    },
    "dates": {
